WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.567 --> 00:00:02.601
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers,
and this is "Late Night."

00:00:02.601 --> 00:00:04.067
We hope you're doing well.

00:00:04.067 --> 00:00:05.100
And now, if you don't mind,
we're going to get to the news.

00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:06.434
President Biden spoke today

00:00:06.434 --> 00:00:08.267
at the White House
Summit for Democracy.

00:00:08.267 --> 00:00:11.367
The speech went so well, we're
even thinking about trying it.

00:00:11.367 --> 00:00:13.400
[ Laughter ]

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:15.601
House Speaker Kevin McCarthy
sent President Biden

00:00:15.601 --> 00:00:18.167
a letter yesterday morning
and asked him to pick a date

00:00:18.167 --> 00:00:21.000
to continue negotiations
over raising the debt ceiling

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:23.167
because nothing conveys
the desire

00:00:23.167 --> 00:00:26.100
to get something done quickly
like sending a letter.

00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:28.033
[ Laughter ]

00:00:28.033 --> 00:00:29.634
That's right.
House Speaker Kevin McCarthy

00:00:29.634 --> 00:00:31.367
sent President Biden
in a letter yesterday

00:00:31.367 --> 00:00:35.033
and outlined Republican demands
for raising the debt ceiling

00:00:35.033 --> 00:00:37.934
and, for the greater good,
Hillary's agreed to it.

00:00:37.934 --> 00:00:41.834
[ Laughter ]

00:00:41.834 --> 00:00:43.300
Not real. Don't worry.

00:00:43.300 --> 00:00:45.167
President Biden
told reporters yesterday

00:00:45.167 --> 00:00:46.934
that he has already used
the full extent

00:00:46.934 --> 00:00:49.367
of his executive authority
to ban assault weapons

00:00:49.367 --> 00:00:51.467
and added that Congress
"has to act."

00:00:51.467 --> 00:00:54.334
"Well, I did win
the Oscar for 'Lincoln,'"

00:00:54.334 --> 00:00:55.868
said George Santos.

00:00:55.868 --> 00:00:58.868
[ Laughter ]

00:00:58.868 --> 00:01:01.367
A bipartisan group of
congressmen announced this week

00:01:01.367 --> 00:01:02.567
that they will reintroduce

00:01:02.567 --> 00:01:04.968
the Protection from
Abusive Passengers Act,

00:01:04.968 --> 00:01:06.701
which would ban
airline passengers

00:01:06.701 --> 00:01:09.501
who've been fined or convicted
of physical violence on flights

00:01:09.501 --> 00:01:13.000
and prison time for anyone who
takes off their shoes and socks.

00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:14.934
[ Laughter ]

00:01:14.934 --> 00:01:16.367
According to a new report,

00:01:16.367 --> 00:01:19.367
former First Lady Melania Trump
likes living at Mar-a-Lago

00:01:19.367 --> 00:01:21.234
because she's surrounded
by people

00:01:21.234 --> 00:01:24.167
who do not say bad things
about former President Trump.

00:01:24.167 --> 00:01:27.767
Okay, but word of advice,
don't go in the kitchen.

00:01:27.767 --> 00:01:31.467
[ Laughter ]

00:01:31.467 --> 00:01:35.501
Pepsi yesterday unveiled its new
logo design for North America.

00:01:35.501 --> 00:01:38.000
And it's fine, I guess,
if that's all you have.

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:40.033
[ Light laughter ]

00:01:40.033 --> 00:01:42.567
[ Laughter ]

00:01:42.567 --> 00:01:44.834
Shoemaker. I was like,
"I'm not sure about that one."

00:01:44.834 --> 00:01:48.567
And Shoemaker was like, "That's
an excellent joke about Pepsi."

00:01:48.567 --> 00:01:50.234
That's why -- I guess
that's about it, though.

00:01:50.234 --> 00:01:53.667
Like, Pepsi's got
a lower ceiling.

00:01:53.667 --> 00:01:56.634
Honda has issued a recall
for more than 300,000 vehicles

00:01:56.634 --> 00:01:58.501
due to an issue
with the side view mirrors.

00:01:58.501 --> 00:02:02.033
Apparently what happened was all
the objects in the mirror

00:02:02.033 --> 00:02:04.167
are exactly as close
as they appear.

00:02:04.167 --> 00:02:06.734
[ Laughter ]

00:02:09.067 --> 00:02:11.634
A driver in Minnesota reportedly
gave a sheriff's deputy

00:02:11.634 --> 00:02:14.501
a get-out-of-jail-free card
from the board game Monopoly

00:02:14.501 --> 00:02:17.834
along with his license
during a recent traffic stop.

00:02:17.834 --> 00:02:20.267
But it didn't work and he ended
up getting his car towed.

00:02:20.267 --> 00:02:24.601
[ Laughter ]

00:02:24.601 --> 00:02:27.000
A Great Dane in Virginia
recently gave birth

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:30.367
to 21 puppies
over 27 hours of labor.

00:02:30.367 --> 00:02:31.734
Though, when it was
all said and done,

00:02:31.734 --> 00:02:33.234
it turned out
she was a Chihuahua.

00:02:33.234 --> 00:02:35.968
[ Laughter ]

00:02:37.501 --> 00:02:40.467
[ Laughter ]
That's right.

00:02:40.467 --> 00:02:41.901
A Great Dane in Virginia

00:02:41.901 --> 00:02:44.234
recently gave birth
to 21 puppies.

00:02:44.234 --> 00:02:46.601
Well, she certainly knows
"roll over."

00:02:46.601 --> 00:02:49.501
[ Laughter ]

00:02:53.534 --> 00:02:55.801
[ Laughter ]

00:02:55.801 --> 00:02:57.868
Scollins.

00:02:57.868 --> 00:02:59.934
According to a new study,
Jacksonville, Florida,

00:02:59.934 --> 00:03:01.667
has the worst drivers
in the country.

00:03:01.667 --> 00:03:03.968
Said drivers, "Let me see that!"

00:03:03.968 --> 00:03:06.467
[ Laughter ]

00:03:06.467 --> 00:03:07.901
And finally, scientists believe

00:03:07.901 --> 00:03:10.200
they've found a new source
of water on the moon,

00:03:10.200 --> 00:03:13.033
and Gwyneth Paltrow already
has it up on her site.

00:03:13.033 --> 00:03:15.968
And that -- that was
a monologue, everybody.

